{"id":"CYCU-20260731-070023","symbol":"CYCU","side":"long","trade_date":"2026-07-31","entry_time":"07:00:23","exit_time":"07:01:17","entry_price":2.77,"exit_price":2.6,"entry_indicator":"no fresh trigger -- price was chased at 2.77, which was well above the EMA9 of 2.63 and VWAP of 2.39 without a local consolidation pullback","exit_indicator":"price dropped sharply to 2.60, breaching the EMA20 level of 2.56 and prompting a panic exit as the momentum completely broke down","shares":3,"time_in_trade":"00:54","pnl_before_comm":-0.51,"commission":0.16,"pnl_after_comm":-0.67,"win":false,"verdict":"The trader attempted a breakout entry at 2.77, which was significantly extended above the EMA9 of 2.63 and VWAP of 2.39 without a proper consolidation base. Chasing price far above key moving averages leaves very little room for a tight, predefined stop, resulting in a rapid failure down to 2.60. The trade violated core momentum rules by buying a high-range breakout late rather than waiting for a disciplined dip to the EMA9 or VWAP. Consequently, the position quickly reversed against the trader, triggering a premature exit before the 2x risk target could be developed.","setup_type":"breakout","better_entry":{"price":2.63,"time":"2026-07-31T06:59:30","reason":"Entering at the EMA9 price of 2.63 provides a much cleaner risk-to-reward ratio and prevents chasing an extended move above the 2.56 EMA20.","how_to_know":"Price pulls back and tests the EMA9 level at 2.63 on the 1-minute chart before showing a bullish bounce confirmation."},"better_exit":{"price":3.15,"time":"2026-07-31T07:05:00","reason":"Exiting at 3.15 captures a clean 2:1 reward relative to a 2.54 stop, locking in gains before the momentum completely fades.","how_to_know":"Price reaches the calculated 2:1 reward target at 3.15 while momentum indicators begin to flatten out."},"suggested_stop":2.54,"suggested_target":3.15,"risk_reward":"1:2","walk_away_rule":"Walk away from any breakout attempt where the entry price is more than 5 percent above the EMA9 of 2.63.","lessons":[{"lesson":"Avoid chasing breakout entries far above the EMA9 of 2.63 and VWAP of 2.39, as it leads to excessive slippage and wide risk.","how_to_know":"Monitor the distance between the current price of 2.77 and the EMA9 of 2.63; if the gap exceeds 5 percent, withhold entry.","tag":"chased_extension"},{"lesson":"Respect the predefined stop loss level instead of holding through a reversal back toward the EMA20 at 2.56.","how_to_know":"The trade breaches the local support level and hits the exit price of 2.60 while MACD histogram contracts below 0.0119.","tag":"held_through_reversal"}],"symbol_info":{"name":"Cuentas Inc.","country":"United States","sector":"Technology","description":"Cuentas Inc. provides fintech and digital banking solutions targeted at the Hispanic and Latino unbanked and underbanked populations. The company offers services including mobile banking, digital wallets, and prepaid debit cards through proprietary software platforms."},"indicators":{"avg_volume_30d":22653438.3,"avg_volume_tag":"avgvol_20m_plus","display_price_high":3,"display_price_low":2.17,"ema20_at_entry":2.5552,"ema9_at_entry":2.6292,"entry_price":2.77,"entry_time":"2026-07-31T07:00:23","entry_vs_ema20":"above","entry_vs_ema9":"above","entry_vs_vwap":"above","exit_price":2.6,"exit_time":"2026-07-31T07:01:17","float_shares":25840335,"float_tag":"float_mid_20m_50m","macd_at_entry":0.0814,"macd_hist_at_entry":0.0119,"macd_hist_prior_bar":0.0137,"macd_signal_at_entry":0.0695,"r_multiple":2,"relative_volume":7.119,"reward_per_share":0.966,"risk_per_share":0.483,"rvol_tag":"rvol_5x_10x","setup_type":"breakout","stop_price":2.287,"target_price":3.736,"volume_on_entry_day":161267755,"vwap_at_entry":2.3932},"bars":[{"c":2.25,"ema20":2.2017,"ema9":2.2207,"h":2.25,"l":2.22,"macd":0.0163,"macd_hist":0.0078,"macd_signal":0.0085,"o":2.24,"t":"2026-07-31T05:31:00","v":40840,"vwap":2.2931},{"c":2.27,"ema20":2.2082,"ema9":2.2306,"h":2.29,"l":2.2